        "line": 167,
        "text": "def scaledPressure (ν : ℝ) (p : PressureField) : PressureField := rescale ν (Real.sqrt ν)⁻¹ p, i.e. (t,x) ↦ ν • p (t, (√ν)⁻¹ • x)"
